<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trigon Health starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trigon Health starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday analyst Margo Vignola had started coverage of Trigon Healthcare Inc with ratings of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Richmond, Va., company closed on Tuesday at 17-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
